steps.text:
分析 从第2行到第 $n$ 行，各行的相同元素较多，可用加边法化行列式为上（块）三角形.解 显然 $D_{1} = \lambda ; D_{2} = \lambda c - ab$ .

当 $n > 2$ 时，将行列式加边，加边后将第 $i (i \geqslant 3)$ 行分别减去第1行，得

$$
D _ {n} = \left| \begin{array}{c c c c c c} 1 & b & \beta & \beta & \dots & \beta \\ 0 & \lambda & a & a & \dots & a \\ 0 & b & c & \beta & \dots & \beta \\ 0 & b & \beta & c & \dots & \beta \\ \vdots & \vdots & \vdots & \vdots & & \vdots \\ 0 & b & \beta & \beta & \dots & \beta \end{array} \right| _ {n + 1} \overset {- r _ {i} + r _ {i}} {\underset {i = 3, \dots , (n + 1)} {=}} \left| \begin{array}{c c c c c c} 1 & b & \beta & \beta & \dots & \beta \\ 0 & \lambda & a & a & \dots & a \\ - 1 & 0 & c - \beta & 0 & \dots & 0 \\ - 1 & 0 & 0 & c - \beta & \dots & 0 \\ \vdots & \vdots & \vdots & \vdots & & \vdots \\ - 1 & 0 & 0 & 0 & \dots . & c - \beta \end{array} \right| _ {n + 1}

\frac {\frac {1}{c - \beta} c _ {i} + c _ {1}}{\overline {{i = 3 , \cdots , (n + 1)}}} \left| \begin{array}{c c c c c c} 1 + \frac {(n - 1) \beta}{c - \beta} & b & \beta & \beta & \dots & \beta \\ \frac {(n - 1) a}{\dot {c} - \beta} & \lambda & a & a & \dots & a \\ 0 & 0 & c - \beta & 0 & \dots & 0 \\ 0 & 0 & 0 & c - \beta & \dots & 0 \\ \vdots & \vdots & \vdots & \vdots & & \vdots \\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & \dots & c - \beta \end{array} \right| _ {n + 1}

\begin{array}{l} = \left[ \left(1 + \frac {(n - 1) \beta}{c - \beta}\right) \lambda - \frac {(n - 1) a}{c - \beta} b \right] (c - \beta) ^ {n - 1} \\ = (c - \beta) ^ {n - 2} [ \lambda c + (n - 2) \lambda \

$$
D _ {n} = \left| \begin{array}{c c c c c c} 1 & b & \beta & \beta & \dots & \beta \\ 0 & \lambda & a & a & \dots & a \\ 0 & b & c & \beta & \dots & \beta \\ 0 & b & \beta & c & \dots & \beta \\ \vdots & \vdots & \vdots & \vdots & & \vdots \\ 0 & b & \beta & \beta & \dots & \beta \end{array} \right| _ {n + 1} \overset {- r _ {i} + r _ {i}} {\underset {i = 3, \dots , (n + 1)} {=}} \left| \begin{array}{c c c c c c} 1 & b & \beta & \beta & \dots & \beta \\ 0 & \lambda & a & a & \dots & a \\ - 1 & 0 & c - \beta & 0 & \dots & 0 \\ - 1 & 0 & 0 & c - \beta & \dots & 0 \\ \vdots & \vdots & \vdots & \vdots & & \vdots \\ - 1 & 0 & 0 & 0 & \dots . & c - \beta \end{array} \right| _ {n + 1}
$$

$$
\frac {\frac {1}{c - \beta} c _ {i} + c _ {1}}{\overline {{i = 3 , \cdots , (n + 1)}}} \left| \begin{array}{c c c c c c} 1 + \frac {(n - 1) \beta}{c - \beta} & b & \beta & \beta & \dots & \beta \\ \frac {(n - 1) a}{\dot {c} - \beta} & \lambda & a & a & \dots & a \\ 0 & 0 & c - \beta & 0 & \dots & 0 \\ 0 & 0 & 0 & c - \beta & \dots & 0 \\ \vdots & \vdots & \vdots & \vdots & & \vdots \\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & \dots & c - \beta \end{array} \right| _ {n + 1}
$$
